member.remarks:
Unit policy: all translations are multiplied by GlobalSettings UnitScaleFactor
(source unit expressed in centimeters), producing centimeters. Axes are NOT converted;
the GlobalSettings axes are recorded on the .

member.summary:
Property  converted to .
Numeric scalars convert tolerantly across widths (e.g. an 'I' i32 read as long);
anything else must match the stored type exactly.

Hierarchy consistency: along each anatomical chain every mapped role must descend
from the previously mapped one (hips above legs and spine, chest branch to arms,
fingers below the hand). Violating assignments are dropped with a note.

Quaternion algebra helpers used throughout the retargeting pipeline.
All angles are radians; quaternions are XYZW ( native);
a * b applies b first (column-vector convention).

